                "text": "I appreciated the chance to visit @QuestDX, a leader in lab testing and healthcare innovation with nearly 1,600 employees right here in Florida\u2019s 15th District. Their work plays a critical role in delivering timely, accurate results that help patients get the care they need. Together, we\u2019re working to advance policies that keep diagnostic testing accessible and affordable for all.",
