                "text": "I toured Florida Cancer Specialists\u2019 new Wesley Chapel facility\u2014bringing world-class, community-based cancer care close to home. In Congress, I\u2019m working to lower barriers to treatment, improve Medicare coverage for early cancer detection, and ensure our providers have the tools they need to deliver hope and healing to patients across Florida.",
